{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lU21yHkGVj1794823058.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產玖瓏山分行經理霍栢雄表示，近期整體租賃氣氛正面，分行最新錄火炭御龍山5座低層A室，單位實用面積773平方呎，3房連套房及儲物房間隔，望馬場景，議價後以35,000元獲承租，實用平均呎租45.3元。<br/>中原霍栢雄指，新租客為區內客，見屋苑環境舒適，單位價錢合理，即決定租入單位自住。據了解，業主則於2018年以1,288萬元買入單位，是次租出單位可享約3.3厘租金回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.438538+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":187,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:57:33.434254+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:18.204817+00:00","content_hash":"658c978814db96ca94a05872afe877aab291afdad84b784255c80dfe577e639a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.438538+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}